# ==============================================================================
# ScrumPulse Git Ignore
# ==============================================================================

# ── .NET & Build Outputs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ist/
[Oo]ut/
[Pp]ublish/
Generated_Code/

# ── Frontend Build Artifacts in the API's wwwroot ─────────────────────────────
# The Angular bundle is produced by `npm run build` and copied into wwwroot by the
# Dockerfile, so it is build output and does not belong in version control. The repo
# previously carried eleven differently hashed copies of main-*.js totalling 18 MB, only
# one of which any deployment actually served.
#
# The genuinely static files the Angular build copies through from
# src/ScrumPulse.UI/public (ads.txt, favicon.ico, robots.txt, sitemap.xml) stay tracked.
src/ScrumPulse.Api/wwwroot/index.html
src/ScrumPulse.Api/wwwroot/*.js
src/ScrumPulse.Api/wwwroot/*.css
src/ScrumPulse.Api/wwwroot/*.map
src/ScrumPulse.Api/wwwroot/media/

# ── Node & Angular ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.angular/
.npm/
.yarn/

# ── Testing, Coverage & Reports ───────────────────────────────────────────────
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
test-results/
coverage/
*.cobertura.xml
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# ── IDEs, Editors & OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
**/.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ── Databases, Backups & Dumps ────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.dmp
*.dump
*.crash

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/

# ── Secrets, Certificates & Local Environments ───────────────────────────────
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.json
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
*.cer
*.crt

# ── Temporary & Scratch Files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tmp
*.temp
*~
*.swp
.system_generated/
